  "summary": "<p>Democrat New Jersey Gov. Mikie Sherrill admitted today that a “software glitch” registered approximately 6,600 noncitizens to vote in her state between 2023 and 2024 — and hundreds of them actually cast ballots. This is the direct result of Democrat policies that refuse basic citizenship checks — and exactly why Congress must pass the SAVE [&#8230;]</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/07/democrat-glitch-registers-thousands-of-noncitizens-to-vote-another-reason-to-pass-the-save-america-act/\">Democrat “Glitch” Registers Thousands of Noncitizens to Vote: Another Reason to Pass the SAVE America Act</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
